{"author":{"id":"746a4d30afc20b78119cb8ed7c194f988174fc252f0e9d9eb92022244ef86db3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1780324480,"nonce":"Uw149WO5KKGdiAEXTGevYZ2MPrY=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDOK4fCvM8AAAABEAgoTw","github-url":"https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/199","origin":"github"},"title":"Bridge survey-line obstacle-avoidance overlay + followed path to the operator station","message":"## Motivation\n\nThe survey-line obstacle-avoidance node (rolker/unh_marine_navigation#30 / PR #51)\npublishes a CAMP overlay on **`survey_obstacle_avoidance`**\n(`visualization_msgs/MarkerArray`: nominal line, adjusted path, \"avoiding\" band,\ntext flag) while it deviates around an obstacle. CAMP auto-discovers any\nMarkerArray, but the `udp_bridge` only forwards an explicit allow-list — so this\ntopic does not reach an over-the-horizon operator until it is added to\n`bizzyboat.yaml`.\n\nSeparately, CAMP's platform path-line overlay subscribes to `received_global_plan`\n(see the fix in rolker/camp#55), which is **not currently bridged** (`plan` at\nline 146 is a different source). Forwarding it lets that overlay render OTH too.\n\n## Changes (`bizzyboat_project11/config/bizzyboat.yaml`)\n\nBoth the WiFi and VPN connection blocks, in each `topics_list` + `topics` dict:\n\n- **`survey_obstacle_avoidance`** — `{source: survey_obstacle_avoidance}`,\n  unthrottled on both links (matches the existing `path_follower_visualization`\n  entry; the topic only publishes while actively avoiding, so the burst is small).\n- **`received_global_plan`** — `{source: received_global_plan}` full-rate on WiFi;\n  `{source: received_global_plan, period: 1.0}` on the constrained VPN/Starlink link.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Namespacing matches the existing entries (bare names; boat namespace `bizzy`).\n- Part of the operator-feedback story for survey-line obstacle avoidance\n  (rolker/unh_marine_navigation#30). Distinct from the reflex-CA awareness work in\n  #183 (Collision Monitor overlay/annunciator).\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context)`","files":null}]}